   "x": 35.0,
   "y": 338.5,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 135.0,
   "text": "API\nPOST /api/documents, /chat (+ /stream), /resume\nPOST /api/action -> button press (X1)\nGET /api/thread/{id} -> check on open (M1..C1)\nPOST /api/connection, /notifications/read\nGET /api/pack/{id} (+ /pdf, /eml)\nPOST /api/webhooks/mock (signed) -> same refresh\nPOST /api/authority (+ /withdraw)  v0.7\nupload of the exact same file -> 409",
