   "id": "t216",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 582,
   "y": 612,
   "width": 460,
   "height": 130.0,
   "text": "C1 / P1 CHECKS (no model):\nrequired docs; names and dates agree; policy period, totals\nquery: item already provided; answered query ends it\ndecision: per-line deduction, clause missing\nP1: bank credit by UTR or amount, short or missing payment\nlate or overdue flags; stage payment_reported / _mismatch / _verified\nv0.7: version choice pending; 2+ covering policies and none chosen;\n  authority withdrawn, expired or not covering submission (all block)",
   "originalText": "C1 / P1 CHECKS (no model):\nrequired docs; names and dates agree; policy period, totals\nquery: item already provided; answered query ends it\ndecision: per-line deduction, clause missing\nP1: bank credit by UTR or amount, short or missing payment\nlate or overdue flags; stage payment_reported / _mismatch / _verified\nv0.7: version choice pending; 2+ covering policies and none chosen;\n  authority withdrawn, expired or not covering submission (all block)",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
