   "id": "t222",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1082,
   "y": 612,
   "width": 540,
   "height": 146.25,
   "text": "NEW IN v0.7 (Wave 4):\nO1: same type again -> replace or keep both; the same bytes again are refused\nX1: replace/keep (approval reset), choose policy, balance claim (archives the\n  first insurer's letters, encloses them, claims the rest), grievance and\n  Ombudsman letters from decision facts (PAUSE: approve), dates recorded\nAuthority: proof checked (grantor = patient, names match); withdrawal pauses\n  work and cancels approval; acting_user sent; the payer may still refuse\nC1: reminders after uploads: grievance 14 days, authority expiry; a revised\n  decision reopens only the decision and payment check; audit log of changes",
   "originalText": "NEW IN v0.7 (Wave 4):\nO1: same type again -> replace or keep both; the same bytes again are refused\nX1: replace/keep (approval reset), choose policy, balance claim (archives the\n  first insurer's letters, encloses them, claims the rest), grievance and\n  Ombudsman letters from decision facts (PAUSE: approve), dates recorded\nAuthority: proof checked (grantor = patient, names match); withdrawal pauses\n  work and cancels approval; acting_user sent; the payer may still refuse\nC1: reminders after uploads: grievance 14 days, authority expiry; a revised\n  decision reopens only the decision and payment check; audit log of changes",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
